# SnapOCR environment variables (copy to .env.local for local dev)
# Never commit real secret values — only this template with placeholders.

# Optional: server-side fallback API key for the Anthropic (Claude) provider.
# Users normally enter their own key in the UI; this fallback is used only when
# the Anthropic provider is selected and no key was entered on screen.
# The Gemini provider always takes its key from the UI (no env fallback).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Port the app binds to. The platform injects PORT in production; defaults to 3000 locally.
# PORT=3000
